stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Inspect
    Inspect --> Blocked: Conflict
    Inspect --> Replay: Completed retry
    Inspect --> Pending: New decision
    Inspect --> Pending: Pending retry
    Pending --> Published: Write after bytes
    Pending --> Published: Already written
    Published --> Completed: Persist completion
    Completed --> Replay: Retry
    Replay --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]
